# Run first: kubectl port-forward deploy/event-bus-deployment 4005:4005
@host = http://localhost:4005

### Publish an event
POST {{host}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "PostCreated",
  "data": { "id": "p1", "title": "First post" }
}

### Get all stored events
GET {{host}}/events
